OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be windy and cloudy with rain
OL,7,Fextending from the west to the whole
OL,8,Fcountry. This rain will continue
OL,9,Fovernight, perhaps turning heavy at
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FCloud and rain initially,
OL,13,Fclearing to a mix of scattered light
OL,14,Fshowers and brighter spells during the
OL,15,Fmorning. Showers building in west late
OL,16,Fafternoon and turning wintry across
OL,17,Fthe hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
