OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FShowers and sunshine for Monday. Rain
OL,7,Fand hill snow for Tuesday. Largely dry
OL,8,Fwith plentiful periods of weak winter
OL,9,Fsunshine on Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,10,Fseasonally low given the generally
OL,11,Fnortherly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
